WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.953
Nextcloud Office Desktop

00:00:01.765 --> 00:00:02.272
app

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.075
Nextcloud has shipped

00:00:03.887 --> 00:00:04.912
a desktop app

00:00:04.736 --> 00:00:06.044
for Nextcloud Office

00:00:06.186 --> 00:00:07.542
bringing its collaborative

00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:08.733
document editing suite

00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:09.511
to the desktop

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.211
On June 9, 2026

00:00:12.365 --> 00:00:13.213
we released the

00:00:13.025 --> 00:00:14.346
first production-ready

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:15.643
version of Euro-Office

00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:17.188
a sovereign collaborative

00:00:16.999 --> 00:00:18.331
office suite developed

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.110
and governed in

00:00:18.922 --> 00:00:19.546
Europe

00:00:20.078 --> 00:00:21.080
With the Nextcloud

00:00:20.892 --> 00:00:22.165
Office Desktop app

00:00:22.342 --> 00:00:23.073
you can edit

00:00:22.885 --> 00:00:24.193
files locally without

00:00:24.005 --> 00:00:25.254
an internet connection

00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:26.443
In this article

00:00:26.537 --> 00:00:27.256
you’ll learn about

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.082
the app’s features

00:00:28.224 --> 00:00:29.037
how to install

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:29.851
it on Windows

00:00:29.898 --> 00:00:31.313
macOS and Linux

00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:31.914
and how to

00:00:31.726 --> 00:00:32.881
co-edit files with

00:00:32.693 --> 00:00:33.671
your team through

00:00:33.483 --> 00:00:34.497
Nextcloud Hub

00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:36.036
Full story on

00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:36.743
the dashboard
